window.__CAPM_DATA=(window.__CAPM_DATA||"")+"\\\"/><\\/div>\",\"stemText\":\"Match the correct scenario to the appropriate process:\",\"choices\":[],\"key\":[],\"answerHtml\":\"<p class=\\\"class_sBZ-0\\\">Correct Answer:<\\/p><div class=\\\"class_s76-0\\\"><img alt=\\\"Source figure\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" src=\\\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\\\"/><\\/div>\",\"answerText\":\"Correct Answer:\",\"type\":\"mapping\",\"special\":{\"type\":\"mapping\",\"targets\":[[\"A\",\"A. The business analyst gathered stakeholder inputs, evaluated the alternatives, and recommended the most cost-effective option.\"],[\"B\",\"B. The business analyst set weekly review meetings with end users, and monthly status meetings with the sponsor.\"],[\"C\",\"C. The business analyst collected product’s sales data and compared them to the business objectives.\"],[\"D\",\"D. The business analyst facilitates a workshop to review the product and assess its readiness to go live.\"]],\"options\":[[\"evaluate\",\"Evaluate solution performance\"],[\"acceptance\",\"Obtain solution acceptance for release\"],[\"viable\",\"Determine viable options and provide recommendations\"],[\"engagement\",\"Determine stakeholder engagement and communication approach\"]],\"correct\":{\"A\":\"viable\",\"B\":\"engagement\",\"C\":\"evaluate\",\"D\":\"acceptance\"}},\"manual\":false,\"sourceIssue\":\"\",\"selectCount\":null},{\"n\":21,\"stemHtml\":\"<p class=\\\"class_s2J-0\\\">A business analyst is identifying the key problems and determining the necessary steps to move to a more efficient future state. Afterward, the business analyst will collaborate with stakeholders to ensure their concerns are addressed and obtain detailed information about their needs. These actions are part of which Business Analysis domains? (Select two)<\\/p>\",\"stemText\":\"A business analyst is identifying the key problems and determining the necessary steps to move to a more efficient future state. Afterward, the business analyst will collaborate with stakeholders to ensure their concerns are addressed and obtain detailed information about their needs. These actions are part of which Business Analysis domains? (Select two)\",\"choices\":[{\"id\":\"A\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"class_s82-0\\\"><span>A.<\\/span><span>     <\\/span>Stakeholder Engagement<\\/p>\",\"text\":\"A. Stakeholder Engagement\"},{\"id\":\"B\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"class_sR-0\\\"><span>B.<\\/span><span>     <\\/span>Traceability and Monitoring<\\/p>\",\"text\":\"B. Traceability and Monitoring\"},{\"id\":\"C\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"class_sR-0\\\"><span>C.<\\/span><span>     <\\/span>Analysis<\\/p>\",\"text\":\"C. Analysis\"},{\"id\":\"D\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"class_sR-0\\\"><span>D.<\\/span><span>     <\\/span>Needs Assessment<\\/p>\",\"text\":\"D. Needs Assessment\"},{\"id\":\"E\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"class_sR-0\\\"><span>E.<\\/span><span>      <\\/span>Solution Evaluation<\\/p>\",\"text\":\"E. Solution Evaluation\"}],\"key\":[\"A\",\"D\"],\"answerHtml\":\"<p class=\\\"class_s9B-0\\\">Correct Answer = A &amp; D<\\/p><p class=\\\"class_s2J-0\\\">Stakeholder engagement focuses on identifying stakeholders, understanding their needs, and engaging them throughout the project. Additionally, Needs assessment concentrates on identifying business problems or opportunities and determining the steps necessary to reach a future state.<\\/p><p class=\\\"class_s80-1\\\"><span>Option B:<\\/span> Traceability and Monitoring is focused on ensuring that requirements and solutions are aligned throughout the project, tracing their status, and monitoring their progress. It does not involve identifying problems or engaging with stakeholders.<\\/p><p class=\\\"class_s80-1\\\"><span>Option C:<\\/span> Although analysis involves examining data, processes, and models, it deals with creating and analyzing models and requirements, not with directly identifying problems or engaging stakeholders<span><\\/span>.<\\/p><p class=\\\"class_s80-1\\\"><span>Option E:<\\/span> Solution Evaluation focuses on assessing how well the implemented solution meets the stakeholders' needs and project objectives, which is something that takes place after the solution is developed, not during the initial phases of identifying problems or needs.<\\/p>\",\"answerText\":\"Correct Answer = A & D Stakeholder engagement focuses on identifying stakeholders, understanding their needs, and engaging them throughout the project. Additionally, Needs assessment concentrates on identifying business problems or opportunities and determining the steps necessary to reach a future state. Option B: Traceability and Monitoring is focused on ensuring that requirements and solutions are aligned throughout the project, tracing their status, and monitoring their progress. It does not involve identifying problems or engaging with stakeholders. Option C: Although analysis involves examining data, processes, and models, it deals with creating and analyzing models and requirements, not with directly identifying problems or engaging stakeholders . Option E: Solution Evaluation focuses on assessing how well the implemented solution meets the stakeholders' needs and project objectives, which is something that takes place after the solution is developed, not during the initial phases of identifying problems or needs.\",\"type\":\"multi\",\"special\":null,\"manual\":false,\"sourceIssue\":\"\",\"selectCount\":2},{\"n\":22,\"stemHtml\":\"<p class=\\\"class_s2J-0\\\">Which elicitation technique should be used when seeking in-depth information from subject matter experts?<\\/p>\",\"stemText\":\"Which elicitation technique should be used when seeking in-depth information from subject matter experts?\",\"choices\":[{\"id\":\"A\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"class_s82-0\\\"><span>A.<\\/span><span>     <\\/span>Collaborative games<\\/p>\",\"text\":\"A. Collaborative games\"},{\"id\":\"B\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"class_sR-0\\\"><span>B.<\\/span><span>     <\\/span>Questionnaires<\\/p>\",\"text\":\"B. Questionnaires\"},{\"id\":\"C\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"class_sR-0\\\"><span>C.<\\/span><span>     <\\/span>Interviews<\\/p>\",\"text\":\"C. Interviews\"},{\"id\":\"D\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"class_sR-0\\\"><span>D.<\\/span><span>     <\\/span>Brainstorming<\\/p>\",\"text\":\"D. Brainstorming\"}],\"key\":[\"C\"],\"answerHtml\":\"<p class=\\\"class_s9B-0\\\">Correct Answer = C<\\/p><p class=\\\"class_s2J-0\\\">Interviews are the most appropriate elicitation technique when seeking in-depth information from subject matter experts. This approach allows for detailed, one-on-one discussions, enabling the business analyst to gather specific, expert insights that other techniques, like collaborative games or questionnaires, may not capture as effectively.<\\/p>\",\"answerText\":\"Correct Answer = C Interviews are the most appropriate elicitation technique when seeking in-depth information from subject matter experts. This approach allows for detailed, one-on-one discussions, enabling the business analyst to gather specific, expert insights that other techniques, like collaborative games or questionnaires, may not capture as effectively.\",\"type\":\"single\",\"special\":null,\"manual\":false,\"sourceIssue\":\"\",\"selectCount\":null},{\"n\":23,\"stemHtml\":\"<p class=\\\"class_s2J-0\\\">What skill enables a business analyst to leverage past experiences to make effective decisions when facing challenges<span><\\/span>?<\\/p>\",\"stemText\":\"What skill enables a business analyst to leverage past experiences to make effective decisions when facing challenges ?\",\"choices\":[{\"id\":\"A\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"class_s82-0\\\"><span>A.<\\/span><span>     <\\/span>Expert judgment<\\/p>\",\"text\":\"A. Expert judgment\"},{\"id\":\"B\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"class_sR-0\\\"><span>B.<\\/span><span>     <\\/span>Technical knowledge<\\/p>\",\"text\":\"B. Technical knowledge\"},{\"id\":\"C\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"class_sR-0\\\"><span>C.<\\/span><span>     <\\/span>Adaptability<\\/p>\",\"text\":\"C. Adaptability\"},{\"id\":\"D\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"class_sR-0\\\"><span>D.<\\/span><span>     <\\/span>Leadership<\\/p>\",\"text\":\"D. Leadership\"}],\"key\":[\"A\"],\"answerHtml\":\"<p class=\\\"class_s9B-0\\\">Correct Answer = A<\\/p><p class=\\\"class_s2J-0\\\">Expert judgment<span> <\\/span>involves using knowledge and expertise accumulated from prior projects and situations to make informed decisions, ensuring that solutions are aligned with both business goals and technical constraints.<\\/p>\",\"answerText\":\"Correct Answer = A Expert judgment involves using knowledge and expertise accumulated from prior projects and situations to make informed decisions, ensuring that solutions are aligned with both business goals and technical constraints.\",\"type\":\"single\",\"special\":null,\"manual\":false,\"sourceIssue\":\"\",\"selectCount\":null},{\"n\":24,\"stemHtml\":\"<p class=\\\"class_s2J-0\\\">Which of the following responsibilities is unique to business analysis?<\\/p>\",\"stemText\":\"Which of the following responsibilities is unique to business analysis?\",\"choices\":[{\"id\":\"A\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"class_s82-0\\\"><span>A.<\\/span><span>     <\\/span>Defining product scope<\\/p>\",\"text\":\"A. Defining product scope\"},{\"id\":\"B\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"class_sR-0\\\"><span>B.<\\/span><span>     <\\/span>Defining project scope<\\/p>\",\"text\":\"B. Defining project scope\"},{\"id\":\"C\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"class_sR-0\\\"><span>C.<\\/span><span>     <\\/span>Managing risks and ensuring timely delivery of projects<\\/p>\",\"text\":\"C. Managing risks and ensuring timely delivery of projects\"},{\"id\":\"D\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"class_sR-0\\\"><span>D.<\\/span><span>     <\\/span>Tracking project progress<\\/p>\",\"text\":\"D. Tracking project progress\"}],\"key\":[\"A\"],\"answerHtml\":\"<p class=\\\"class_s9B-0\\\">Correct Answer = A<\\/p><p class=\\\"class_s2J-0\\\">Business analysis focuses on defining the product scope, which includes understanding business needs, gathering requirements, and ensuring the final product features and functions align with stakeholder expectations (PMI Guide to Business Analysis, page 17).<\\/p><p class=\\\"class_s80-1\\\"><span>Option B:<\\/span> Defining project scope is primarily a project management responsibility. The project scope outlines the work required to complete the project, including tasks, deliverables, and boundaries of the project.<\\/p><p class=\\\"class_s80-1\\\"><span>Option C:<\\/span> Managing risks and ensuring timely delivery is part of project management. The project manager handles scheduling, risk management, and tracking deadlines to make sure the project is completed on time.<\\/p><p class=\\\"class_s80-1\\\"><span>Option D:<\\/span> Tracking project progress is a key function of project management. Project managers monitor task completion, deadlines, and resource allocation to ensure the project stays on track.<\\/p>\",\"answerText\":\"Correct Answer = A Business analysis focuses on defining the product scope, which includes understanding business needs, gathering requirements, and ensuring the final product features and functions align with stakeholder expectations (PMI Guide to Business Analysis, page 17). Option B: Defining project scope is primarily a project management responsibility. The project scope outlines the work required to complete the project, including tasks, deliverables, and boundaries of the project. Option C: Managing risks and ensuring timely delivery is part of project management. The project manager handles scheduling, risk management, and tracking deadlines to make sure the project is completed on time. Option D: Tracking project progress is a key function of project management. Project managers monitor task completion, deadlines, and resource allocation to ensure the project stays on track.\",\"type\":\"single\",\"special\":null,\"manual\":false,\"sourceIssue\":\"\",\"selectCount\":null},{\"n\":25,\"stemHtml\":\"<p class=\\\"class_sTU-0\\\">A business analyst used the following model in analyzing product features from the viewpoint of the customer. What technique did the business analysis use?<\\/p><div class=\\\"class_s76-0\\\"><img alt=\\\"Source figure\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" src=\\\"data:image/jpeg;base64,";
